---

<BaseLayout
  page="technology-leadership"
  title="Technology Leadership | Tim Gabaree"
  description="Tim Gabaree helps leaders and teams set technology priorities, strengthen operations, manage cybersecurity, and adopt AI responsibly."
  canonicalPath="/technology-leadership"
  ogType="website"
  image="/media/profile-pic-tim-gabaree-900x1200.webp"
  imageAlt="Portrait of Tim"
  preloadImage={undefined}
  structuredData={structuredData}
  scripts={[]}
>
<main
        id="main-content"
        class="technology-leadership-page">

        <!-- Technology Leadership Hero -->

        <img src="/media/background-pic-architecture-1920x942.webp" alt="" width="1920" height="942" class="page-background-image" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async">
        <section
            class="technology-leadership-hero"
            aria-labelledby="technology-leadership-title">

            <div class="technology-leadership-hero-content">

                <p class="technology-leadership-eyebrow">
                    CIO Perspective
                </p>

                <h1 id="technology-leadership-title">
                    Technology Leadership
                </h1>

                <p class="technology-leadership-intro">
                    Technology should help people do their jobs and help the organization meet its goals.
                </p>

                <p>
                    I set priorities, strengthen teams, and improve systems—with clear responsibility for the work and its results.
                </p>

            </div>

        </section>

        <!-- End Technology Leadership Hero -->

        <!-- Leadership Perspective -->

        <section
            class="technology-leadership-section"
            aria-labelledby="leadership-perspective-title">

            <div class="technology-leadership-content">

                <h2 id="leadership-perspective-title">
                    Leadership Perspective
                </h2>

                <p>
                    I start by understanding what the organization needs to accomplish, what is working, and what is getting in the way.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Then I work with leaders and teams to set priorities, choose where to invest, and make sure people have the tools and support to deliver.
                </p>

            </div>

        </section>

        <!-- End Leadership Perspective -->

        <!-- Areas of Focus -->

        <section
            class="technology-leadership-section"
            aria-labelledby="technology-focus-title">

            <div class="technology-leadership-content">

                <h2 id="technology-focus-title">
                    Areas of Focus
                </h2>

                <div class="technology-leadership-focus-grid">

                    <article class="technology-leadership-focus">

                        <h3>
                            Infrastructure &amp; Operations
                        </h3>

                        <p>
                            Keep infrastructure, cloud services, and networks reliable so people can do their work.
                        </p>

                    </article>

                    <article class="technology-leadership-focus">

                        <h3>
                            Modernization
                        </h3>

                        <p>
                            Improve systems where there is a clear business need, with attention to cost, risk, and whether people are ready for the change.
                        </p>

                    </article>

                    <article class="technology-leadership-focus">

                        <h3>
                            Cybersecurity &amp; Risk
                        </h3>

                        <p>
                            Make security part of how systems are chosen, built, and run—not an afterthought.
                        </p>

                    </article>

                    <article class="technology-leadership-focus">

                        <h3>
                            Technology Investment
                        </h3>

                        <p>
                            Weigh expected benefits and risks against the full cost of buying, running, and maintaining a system.
                        </p>

                    </article>

                    <article class="technology-leadership-focus">

                        <h3>
                            AI Strategy &amp; Adoption
                        </h3>

                        <p>
                            Choose useful applications for AI, set safeguards, and help teams adopt it responsibly.
                        </p>

                    </article>

                    <article class="technology-leadership-focus">

                        <h3>
                            Vendor Performance
                        </h3>

                        <p>
                            Set clear expectations for vendors, track their service, and hold them accountable for cost and results.
                        </p>

                    </article>

                </div>

            </div>

        </section>

        <!-- End Areas of Focus -->

        <!-- Selected Experience -->

        <section
            class="technology-leadership-section"
            aria-labelledby="technology-experience-title">

            <div class="technology-leadership-content">

                <h2 id="technology-experience-title">
                    Selected Experience
                </h2>

                <div class="technology-leadership-evidence">

                    <p>
                        Directed a $170M government technology portfolio spanning
                        infrastructure, applications, governance, and risk.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        Led enterprise technology, infrastructure, operations, and service
                        delivery across more than 100 locations supporting 5,000+ personnel.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        Rationalized 436 on-premises applications to Azure and established
                        technology guardrails supporting $25M in projected three-year savings.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        Identified $1.5M in duplicate vendor spend across portfolio businesses
                        while establishing stronger vendor expectations and acquisition
                        integration criteria.
                    </p>

                </div>

            </div>

        </section>

        <!-- End Selected Experience -->

        <!-- Connect -->

        <section
            class="technology-leadership-connect"
            aria-labelledby="technology-connect-title">

            <div class="technology-leadership-content">

                <h2 id="technology-connect-title">
                    Let’s Talk
                </h2>

                <p>
                    Explore my experience and results, or get in touch about a technology or leadership challenge.
                </p>

                <p>
                    <a
                        class="technology-leadership-link"
                        href="/contact">
                        Connect with Tim
                    </a>
                </p>

            </div>

        </section>

        <!-- End Connect -->

    </main>
</BaseLayout>
